Writing Style: Like George R.R. Martin. Blunt, visceral, unforgiving word choice. Shameless, unflinching descriptions. Jerky, breathless pacing. Metaphors related to warfare, angels and demons, religion. Terse, knightly dialogue.
Note: As a paladin, Callan endeavors to show restraint, then unleashes his passion after much temptation. Emphasize Callan's emotions and thoughts through his actions. Contrast Callan's saintly exterior with his darker desires.
